      "verification_note": "R.S. 47:32 at https://www.legis.la.gov/legis/Law.aspx?d=101946 states the flat 3 percent rate from 2025 (Acts 2024, 3rd Ex. Sess., No. 11), and R.S. 47:294 (d=101761) and the 2025 IT-540 instructions confirm the 2025 $12,500 / $25,000 standard deduction. R.S. 47:294(B) prescribes CPI-U indexing from 2026 without stating the held $12,838 / $25,676 amounts, and the LDR individual-income-tax page prints the 2022-2024 rates and threshold sets under a duplicated married-joint heading without the 2024 $4,500 / $9,000 deduction.",
